wn as mr needle mouse  a hedgehog would win out leading to the  sonic we now know  remember how i mentioned sonic's rabbit  prototype involved in picking up items  and throwing them at enemies with his  ears  well this very same prototype would be  repurposed four years later for a new  game in 1995  created by what would eventually become  known as sonic team  rystar which is a highly underrated game  that you should check out if you enjoy  platform games and have the time  sonic was made blue as his primary color  in order to match sega's corporate blue  logo  according to naoto oshima this was also  because in color psychology blue  signifies coolness and peacefulness  it also reflects my hope that the open  sky is blue forever  i made sonic's shoes red so that they  could be clearly seen when he begins to  run at high speed  sonic's design and overall attitude  takes inspiration from a variety of  famous pop culture figures  the first of these was michael jackson  who by the way will come up again later  in the list  sonic shoes were based on his boost from  the bad album meanwhile the red and  white was an inspiration  from none other than santa claus in fact  naoto oshima says his dream growing up  was to either be a cartoonist or to  become  santa claus so you can see how that  ended up serving as an inspiration  finally sonic's attitude was meant to be  based off of the united states then  president bill clinton's get it done  attitude  chili dog while sonic is known for his  attitude he originally had a whole lot  more which was either cut by sega of  america  or due to the limitations of technology  of the time and needing to save space  on the game's cartridge for one sonic  had a human girlfriend  so that infamous scene from sonico6  yeah that could have happened a lot  earlier this girlfriend was named  madonna and according to naoto oshima  sonic is smaller than a human but he had  a human girlfriend who is a very  attractive and would chase sonic  so 